---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Research Workflow Guidebook
description: Choose a language and follow a research workflow guide from local setup to writing and GitHub collaboration.
lang: en
langSwitch:
  url: /ko/
  label: 한국어
pageClass: page-landing
---
{% set currentUpdates = updates.completedByLang.en %}
{% set latestUpdate = currentUpdates[0] %}
<main>
  <section class="landing-hero">
    <h1 class="wrap hero-h1">Efficient Research Workflow</h1>
    <p class="wrap lead">Build an efficient research workspace <span class="responsive-break">with LaTeX, VS Code, and GitHub</span></p>
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <aside class="hero-panel panel">
        <div class="updates-panel-header">
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ ui.en.recentUpdates }}</p>
          <a class="updates-more-link" href="/en/updates/">{{ ui.en.moreUpdates }}</a>
        </div>
        {% if latestUpdate %}
          <dl class="updates-list">
            <div>
              {% set item = latestUpdate %}
              {% include "components/update-entry.njk" %}
            </div>
          </dl>
        {% endif %}
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Route Map</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid route-map-grid">
        {% for section in navigation.sections %}
          <a class="feature-card panel card--{{ section.key }}" href="{{ section.url.en }}">
            <div class="card-logo-row">
              {% if section.key == "initial-setup" %}
                <img class="card-logo card-logo--latex-full" src="/assets/images/LaTeX_project_logo_bird.svg.png" alt="LaTeX">
                <img class="card-logo card-logo--latex-compact" src="/assets/images/latex-project-logo_288x288.png" alt="LaTeX">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/Visual_Studio_Code_1.35_icon.svg.png" alt="VS Code">
              {% elif section.key == "writing-in-vs-code" %}
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/Visual_Studio_Code_1.35_icon.svg.png" alt="VS Code">
              {% elif section.key == "git-github" %}
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/git-logo.png" alt="Git">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/GitHub-Mark.png" alt="GitHub">
              {% elif section.key == "collaboration" %}
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/git-logo.png" alt="Git">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/GitHub-Mark.png" alt="GitHub">
                <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/images/overleaf-o-logo-primary.jpg" alt="Overleaf">
              {% elif section.key == "python" %}
                <img class="card-logo card-logo--python-full" src="/assets/images/python-logo-long.png" alt="Python">
                <img class="card-logo card-logo--python-compact" src="/assets/images/python-logo-short.png" alt="Python">
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <p class="card-kicker">{{ section.kicker.en }}</p>
            <h3>{{ section.title.en }}</h3>
            <p>{{ section.summary.en }}</p>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="editorial-band discussions-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a
        class="hero-panel panel discussions-card"
        href="https://github.com/research-workflow-guides/research-workflow-guides.github.io/discussions"
        aria-label="Open GitHub Discussions for research-workflow-guides/research-workflow-guides.github.io"
      >
        <p class="eyebrow">Discussions</p>
        <p class="discussion-heading">Questions, suggestions, and feedback</p>
        <ul class="discussion-list">
          <li>Ask questions about the workflow covered in this guide.</li>
          <li>Suggest improvements to the documentation.</li>
          <li>Report unclear explanations or missing steps.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="discussion-copy">To get started, click this card to open the Discussions page.</p>
      </a>
      <a
        class="hero-panel panel discussions-card sponsor-card"
        href="https://github.com/sponsors/kyjung2357"
        aria-label="Open GitHub Sponsors for kyjung2357"
      >
        <p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
        <p class="discussion-heading">Support us</p>
        <p class="discussion-copy">I'd like to buy the authors a coffee.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
